.TH focusforge-cli-cache-clear 1  "clear 0.1.0-rc.1" 
.SH NAME
focusforge\-cli\-cache\-clear \- Remove every entry from the stage cache
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfocusforge\-cli cache clear\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v \fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove every entry from the stage cache
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the JSON report instead of human\-readable text
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Increase log detail (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Log errors only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0-rc.1
